{"action_ordinal":2,"episode_id":"r1ep-ad8b849f95642f8675884f1302bc5fa1","kind":"filesystem_observation","observation_id":"obs-0002","observation_sha256":"82daa6aa42e12a8f6d1d756465877815632ab56061794042bdb8949713966071","ordinal":2,"provider_round":2,"question_sha256":"4ee05a67f703e8f99cd50223ced4e288bdefe5c9a465046ddf56d061a3a6bbcd","read_receipt":{"action_ordinal":2,"episode_id":"r1ep-ad8b849f95642f8675884f1302bc5fa1","key_id":"4b851560a7b5a685e474fc77feb87740235f81d3e72ea108e9d81047dee01b08","ordinal":2,"provider_round":2,"question_sha256":"4ee05a67f703e8f99cd50223ced4e288bdefe5c9a465046ddf56d061a3a6bbcd","receipt_mac":"d340b79d3bf29a69acf361485db705369bd14594e8b02a8ee0df9d50fad8f90d","result_sha256":"cd857f5415da6e511c289e805ebd8d0e2fe1da8b4af32f345ca9a7f221789d0d","schema_version":2,"snapshot_ref_sha256":"fb38c6c1d50aeae07cd391df0e916f04520cf904ce68add77202a37c1102d1f9"},"result":{"canonical_args":{"case_sensitive":false,"max_results":100,"path":"/memories","pattern":"nostalg|grandm|grandf|grandpa|grandma|memories|cousin|uncle|aunt"},"content":"/memories/session-12.md:L18: Calvin: Wow, Dave, that's awesome! Must feel great to have a hobby that makes you proud. Remember any good memories from working on cars with your dad?\n/memories/session-12.md:L21: Dave: Yeah, definitely! I have fond memories of working on cars with my dad as a kid. We spent one summer restoring an old car. It was hard work, but seeing the end result and knowing that we did it together was really satisfying.\n/memories/session-18.md:L39: Dave: That sounds awesome, Calvin! Live music is the best. I'm sure you're gonna have a blast on tour and make some awesome memories. If you ever want to check out my garage and see some cool cars, I'd love to show you around. Keep rockin'!\n/memories/session-19.md:L22: Calvin: Aww, bummer! I would've loved to hear that music. Oh well, some of the best memories can't be captured on video or audio. It's like those special moments that stay in our hearts and minds. Take a look at this cool Disney poster!\n/memories/session-20.md:L20: Dave: Wow, thanks Calvin! I love the way the sunlight hits this. It's definitely a great symbol of all your hard work. I bet you feel really proud when you look at it. Any special memories with it?\n/memories/session-20.md:L26: Dave: Wow, Calvin, that's awesome! That feeling of freedom in the summer is the best. A moment of reflection not only makes the journey interesting but also productive! Hey, any songs from your childhood that bring back memories?\n/memories/session-20.md:L56: Dave: Nice one, Calvin! Let's make some awesome memories and have a great time. See ya soon!\n/memories/session-25.md:L89: Dave: Glad you like it, Cal! It reminds me of the good times I've had at concerts last month. Music has a way of connecting us and making memories. Take a look at this picture, the atmosphere was amazing!\n/memories/session-25.md:L93: Calvin: Music has a way of bringing us together and creating unforgettable memories. It's unbeatable in terms of the energy it brings.\n/memories/session-29.md:L15: Dave: Whoa, that's great Calvin! Seeing your old friend must have brought back so many memories. It's awesome to have someone who's been there since the start to support us.\n/memories/session-29.md:L18: Calvin: Remembering those days made me so nostalgic! Freestyling and talking about getting famous, it's crazy how life has changed. But being around certain people still sparks those same feelings. Take a look at how we freestyled when we were teenagers!","content_sha256":"95b65270c98456e0713c0b1898fe541919b5fc93e8494c1e96de9e056ced135d","coverage":[{"line_end":18,"line_start":18,"path":"/memories/session-12.md"},{"line_end":21,"line_start":21,"path":"/memories/session-12.md"},{"line_end":39,"line_start":39,"path":"/memories/session-18.md"},{"line_end":22,"line_start":22,"path":"/memories/session-19.md"},{"line_end":20,"line_start":20,"path":"/memories/session-20.md"},{"line_end":26,"line_start":26,