{"action_ordinal":3,"episode_id":"r1ep-ad8b849f95642f8675884f1302bc5fa1","kind":"filesystem_observation","observation_id":"obs-0003","observation_sha256":"7b5339c981e767724815afe90ba8e7c86088335f7071a0441fe87e61b8407e58","ordinal":3,"provider_round":3,"question_sha256":"4ee05a67f703e8f99cd50223ced4e288bdefe5c9a465046ddf56d061a3a6bbcd","read_receipt":{"action_ordinal":3,"episode_id":"r1ep-ad8b849f95642f8675884f1302bc5fa1","key_id":"4b851560a7b5a685e474fc77feb87740235f81d3e72ea108e9d81047dee01b08","ordinal":3,"provider_round":3,"question_sha256":"4ee05a67f703e8f99cd50223ced4e288bdefe5c9a465046ddf56d061a3a6bbcd","receipt_mac":"aefbd36e3bb05826b890f7c12c27f16c78d0315b06050bd05ca0051be51cb953","result_sha256":"47fef414559f0d6480f2272cd03707c06bdce0b2a4f98001c1970be1082eb734","schema_version":2,"snapshot_ref_sha256":"fb38c6c1d50aeae07cd391df0e916f04520cf904ce68add77202a37c1102d1f9"},"result":{"canonical_args":{"case_sensitive":false,"max_results":100,"path":"/memories","pattern":"\\b(dad|mom|father|mother|brother|sister|parents|grandpa|grandma|family)\\b"},"content":"/memories/session-12.md:L15: Dave: Hey Calvin, I understand the stress of getting a car serviced. Fixing cars is like therapy for me. Growing up working on cars with my dad, refurbishing them gives me a sense of fulfillment.\n/memories/session-12.md:L18: Calvin: Wow, Dave, that's awesome! Must feel great to have a hobby that makes you proud. Remember any good memories from working on cars with your dad?\n/memories/session-12.md:L21: Dave: Yeah, definitely! I have fond memories of working on cars with my dad as a kid. We spent one summer restoring an old car. It was hard work, but seeing the end result and knowing that we did it together was really satisfying.\n/memories/session-20.md:L29: Calvin: Yeah, there's this one song that always makes me smile. It played during a road trip with my dad and we had so much fun singing along to it.\n/memories/session-20.md:L32: Dave: Sounds awesome, Calvin! Road trips with family are always a treat. What's the name of the song?\n/memories/session-22.md:L27: Dave: Thanks Calvin! I've spent a lot of time and effort on it. It's not just a hobby, it's a passion. It's like therapy, a way to get away from everyday stress. When I was little I'd spend hours in my dad's garage, tinkering with engines - it was like my own sanctuary. Now I'm lucky enough to do this as a job, to take something broken and make it into something awesome.\n/memories/session-26.md:L28: Dave: Thanks, Calvin! It's always been my thing. My dad took me to my first car show when I was 10, and I was wow-ed! I was hooked and wanted to learn more. Now I'm an automotive engineer and it's crazy to think that something so powerful and cool can be made from small parts.","content_sha256":"30a7b3614591a5c9b143b3926daba48c8f6d5cb2de96b8af164df35d7d5d504e","coverage":[{"line_end":15,"line_start":15,"path":"/memories/session-12.md"},{"line_end":18,"line_start":18,"path":"/memories/session-12.md"},{"line_end":21,"line_start":21,"path":"/memories/session-12.md"},{"line_end":29,"line_start":29,"path":"/memories/session-20.md"},{"line_end":32,"line_start":32,"path":"/memories/session-20.md"},{"line_end":27,"line_start":27,"path":"/memories/session-22.md"},{"line_end":28,"line_start":28,"path":"/memories/session-26.md"}],"post_tree_sha256":"ca39361e8e23f204a9fda55fc83e3ce7f411c7c8d582939aa63688c1923c7679","pre_tree_sha256":"ca39361e8e23f204a9fda55fc83e3ce7f411c7c8d582939aa63688c1923c7679","protocol_version":"center-table12-readonly-v1","result_count":7,"result_sha256":"47fef414559f0d6480f2272cd03707c06bdce0b2a4f98001c1970be1082eb734","root_survey":false,"tool_name":"grep","truncated":false,"whole_tree_grep":true},"schema_version":2,"store_id":"s1","store_snapshot_sha256":"ca39361e8e23f204a9fda55fc83e3ce7f411c7c8d582939aa63688c1923c7679"}
