{"action_ordinal":12,"episode_id":"r1ep-ad8b849f95642f8675884f1302bc5fa1","kind":"filesystem_observation","observation_id":"obs-0008","observation_sha256":"09534703bb5cf19a336f86ed81ef3c18c8ee5abdee0ec3032ee6b97a9e90e93b","ordinal":8,"provider_round":7,"question_sha256":"4ee05a67f703e8f99cd50223ced4e288bdefe5c9a465046ddf56d061a3a6bbcd","read_receipt":{"action_ordinal":12,"episode_id":"r1ep-ad8b849f95642f8675884f1302bc5fa1","key_id":"4b851560a7b5a685e474fc77feb87740235f81d3e72ea108e9d81047dee01b08","ordinal":8,"provider_round":7,"question_sha256":"4ee05a67f703e8f99cd50223ced4e288bdefe5c9a465046ddf56d061a3a6bbcd","receipt_mac":"1a832bdaa7f5738d43571944962b293296174c1c12862b8f9e5d9859a9999833","result_sha256":"a07dce75b2fca3f94022ff2d43daaa25788583398c25e3e48b6c2e6550dabc7c","schema_version":2,"snapshot_ref_sha256":"fb38c6c1d50aeae07cd391df0e916f04520cf904ce68add77202a37c1102d1f9"},"result":{"canonical_args":{"end_line":24,"path":"/memories/session-12.md","start_line":1},"content":"L1: ---\nL2: name: session-12\nL3: description: Session 12 on 2023-08-03 between Calvin and Dave.\nL4: ---\nL5: \nL6: # Session 12\nL7: \nL8: Date: 1:12 pm on 3 August, 2023\nL9: Speakers: Calvin, Dave\nL10: Conversation: conv-50\nL11: \nL12: Calvin: Hey Dave, long time no see! I just took my Ferrari for a service and it was so stressful. I'm kinda attached to it. Can you relate? What kind of hobbies give you a feeling of being restored?\nL13: [S12T1] (dia_id: D12:1)\nL14: \nL15: Dave: Hey Calvin, I understand the stress of getting a car serviced. Fixing cars is like therapy for me. Growing up working on cars with my dad, refurbishing them gives me a sense of fulfillment.\nL16: [S12T2] (dia_id: D12:2)\nL17: \nL18: Calvin: Wow, Dave, that's awesome! Must feel great to have a hobby that makes you proud. Remember any good memories from working on cars with your dad?\nL19: [S12T3] (dia_id: D12:3)\nL20: \nL21: Dave: Yeah, definitely! I have fond memories of working on cars with my dad as a kid. We spent one summer restoring an old car. It was hard work, but seeing the end result and knowing that we did it together was really satisfying.\nL22: [S12T4] (dia_id: D12:4)\nL23: \nL24: Calvin: That's awesome, Dave! Working together on projects like that really brings people closer. Do you have any pictures from that time?","content_sha256":"8b29065afa50ee03ad8f703236a7719808a5a59faab458e0ca32afd658afc24a","coverage":[{"line_end":24,"line_start":1,"path":"/memories/session-12.md"}],"post_tree_sha256":"ca39361e8e23f204a9fda55fc83e3ce7f411c7c8d582939aa63688c1923c7679","pre_tree_sha256":"ca39361e8e23f204a9fda55fc83e3ce7f411c7c8d582939aa63688c1923c7679","protocol_version":"center-table12-readonly-v1","result_count":24,"result_sha256":"a07dce75b2fca3f94022ff2d43daaa25788583398c25e3e48b6c2e6550dabc7c","root_survey":false,"tool_name":"view","truncated":false,"whole_tree_grep":false},"schema_version":2,"store_id":"s1","store_snapshot_sha256":"ca39361e8e23f204a9fda55fc83e3ce7f411c7c8d582939aa63688c1923c7679"}
